  "title": "NCR Voyix to Present at the ICR Conference",
  "summary": "NCR Voyix Corporation will present its restaurant technology strategy at the ICR Conference in Orlando, FL on Tuesday, January 13, 2026, at 1:30 p.m. Eastern Time. Benny Tadele, Executive Vice President and President of Restaurants, will share how NCR Voyix is helping operators tackle industry challenges, from labor shortages to rising guest expectations, by delivering smarter, faster and more connected solutions.",
